flowchart LR

  UI[SplitOS Manager / Mode UX / Game Launcher]

  ID[Product Identity & Entitlement]
  ACCESS[Managed Runtime Access]
  MODE[Mode Intent & Active Mode State]
  TRANS[Mode Transition Coordination]
  POLICY[Mode Policy]
  APP[Application Lifecycle Policy]
  DISPLAY[Display Context]
  AUDIO[Audio Context]
  INPUT[Input Context]
  POWER[Power / Resource Context]
  HW[Hardware Context Evaluation]
  LIB[Game Library Representation]
  PROFILE[Game Profiles]
  OPT[Game Optimization Policy]
  LAUNCH[Game Launch Orchestration]
  SHARED[Shared App Experience]
  COMPAT[Compatibility Management]
  UPDATE[Update Orchestration]
  RECOVERY[Recovery Coordination]
  OBS[Observability & Diagnostics]

  WIN[Windows / Drivers / Devices]
  GC[External Game Clients]
  BACKEND[SplitOS Account Backend]
  PAY[Payment Provider]
  MS[Microsoft Windows Source / Updates]

  UI -->|IF-ID / IF-ACCESS| ID
  ID --> ACCESS
  UI -->|IF-MODE-001| MODE
  MODE -->|IF-TRANS-001| TRANS
  TRANS -->|IF-POLICY-001| POLICY
  TRANS -->|IF-APP-002| APP
  TRANS --> DISPLAY
  TRANS --> AUDIO
  TRANS --> INPUT
  TRANS --> POWER

  LAUNCH -->|IF-PROFILE-001| PROFILE
  LAUNCH -->|IF-HW-001| HW
  LAUNCH -->|IF-OPT-001| OPT
  LAUNCH -->|IF-LIB-002| LIB
  LAUNCH --> DISPLAY
  LAUNCH --> INPUT

  UI -->|IF-LAUNCH-001| LAUNCH
  UI -->|IF-SHARED-001| SHARED

  ID <-->|EXT-ID-*| BACKEND
  BACKEND <-->|EXT-PAY-*| PAY

  LIB <-->|EXT-GC-002| GC
  LAUNCH <-->|EXT-GC-004/005| GC

  DISPLAY <-->|EXT-WIN-DISPLAY-*| WIN
  AUDIO <-->|EXT-WIN-AUDIO-*| WIN
  INPUT <-->|EXT-WIN-INPUT-*| WIN
  POWER <-->|EXT-WIN-POWER-*| WIN
  HW <-->|platform evidence| WIN
  APP <-->|process/app evidence| WIN

  COMPAT <-->|EXT-MS-UPDATE-001| MS
  UPDATE -->|IF-COMPAT-001| COMPAT
  RECOVERY --> MODE
  RECOVERY --> UPDATE

  ID -.diagnostics.-> OBS
  TRANS -.diagnostics.-> OBS
  LAUNCH -.diagnostics.-> OBS
  UPDATE -.diagnostics.-> OBS
  RECOVERY -.diagnostics.-> OBS
